{"ticker":"AME","updated":"2026-11-27T22:36:30Z","profile":{"longName":"AMETEK, Inc.","shortName":"AMETEK, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ametek.com","fullTimeEmployees":22500,"marketCap":52823404544,"trailingPE":32.48942,"forwardPE":23.840448,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.448494,"pegRatio":2.68,"targetMeanPrice":288.83334,"targetHighPrice":329.0,"targetLowPrice":217.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.173,"earningsGrowth":0.156,"grossMargins":0.36971,"operatingMargins":0.26591,"profitMargins":0.19913,"totalRevenue":8191587840,"beta":0.971,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":261.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":195.3,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.6},"summary":"AMETEK, Inc. manufactures and sells electronic instruments (EIG) and electromechanical (EMG) devices in the United States and internationally. It operates through EIG and EMG segments. The company offers advanced instruments for the process, aerospace, power, and industrial markets; process and analytical instruments for the oil and gas, petrochemical, pharmaceutical, semiconductor, automation, and food and beverage industries; instruments to the laboratory equipment, ultra-precision manufacturing, medical, and test and measurement markets; power quality monitoring and metering devices, uninterruptible power supplies, programmable power and electromagnetic compatibility test equipment, and gas turbines sensors; dashboard instruments for heavy trucks and other vehicles; instrumentation and controls for food and beverage industries; and aircraft and engine sensors, embedded computing, monitoring, power supplies, fuel and fluid measurement, and data acquisition systems for aerospace and defense industry. It also provides engineered medical components and devices, automation solutions, thermal management systems, specialty metals, and electrical interconnects; single-use and consumable surgical instruments, implantable components, and drug delivery systems; engineered electrical connectors and electronics packaging; precision motion control products for data storage, medical device","summary_zh":"AMETEK, Inc. 在美國和國際上製造和銷售電子儀器 (EIG) 和機電 (EMG) 設備。它透過 EIG 和 EMG 部門運作。該公司為製程、航空航太、電力和工業市場提供先進的儀器；用於石油和天然氣、石化、製藥、半導體、自動化以及食品和飲料行業的過程和分析儀器；實驗室設備、超精密製造、醫療以及測試和測量市場的儀器；電能品質監測和計量裝置、不間斷實驗室設備、超精密製造、醫療以及測試和測量市場的儀器；電能品質監測和計量裝置、不間斷實驗室設備和測量市場停電電源、可程式電源和電磁相容性測試設備以及燃氣渦輪機感測器；重型卡車和其他車輛的儀表板儀表；食品和飲料行業的儀表和控制；以及飛機和發動機感測器、嵌入式計算、監控、電源、燃料和流體測量以及航空航天和國防工業的數據採集系統。它還提供工程醫療組件和設備、自動化解決方案、熱管理系統、特殊金屬和電氣互連；一次性和消耗性手術器械、植入式組件和藥物輸送系統；工程電氣連接器和電子產品封裝；用於數據存儲、醫療設備的精密運動控制產品","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":187.73,"h":189.18,"l":186.1,"c":186.87,"v":1299900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":186.78,"h":189.01,"l":186.61,"c":188.0,"v":1836100},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":186.88,"h":189.07,"l":186.74,"c":187.44,"v":849300},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":187.54,"h":188.79,"l":185.46,"c":186.13,"v":1050800},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":186.36,"h":186.82,"l":183.56,"c":183.75,"v":1874800},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":187.0,"h":187.09,"l":182.42,"c":182.99,"v":1360100},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":183.98,"h":183.98,"l":181.25,"c":181.42,"v":1283200},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":182.6,"h":183.33,"l":180.5,"c":183.19,"v":1359100},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":183.9,"h":184.86,"l":181.78,"c":183.31,"v":1051500},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":184.04,"h":185.73,"l":179.24,"c":179.28,"v":961600},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":180.14,"h":183.06,"l":179.79,"c":182.24,"v":900700},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":180.69,"h":186.73,"l":180.16,"c":185.78,"v":1439100},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":187.51,"h":188.17,"l":183.57,"c":185.78,"v":1181400},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":186.44,"h":186.82,"l":183.65,"c":184.49,"v":781700},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":184.15,"h":186.09,"l":183.07,"c":185.47,"v":1079700},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":186.97,"h":188.0,"l":186.0,"c":187.39,"v":767500},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":187.0,"h":189.34,"l":186.66,"c":188.3,"v":691300},{"t":"2025-10-22",